@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowThickness 3

title LSTM Encoder – Role in MiRACLE

' Colors
' Inputs:  #D9EDF7
' Model:   #E6E6FA
' Output:  #DFF0D8

rectangle "Sliding window of history\n(past PV + weather,\n≈24 h at 15 min)" as WIN #D9EDF7

rectangle "Stacked LSTM Encoder\n(pretrained global core\n+ site adapted layers)" as LSTM #E6E6FA

rectangle "Latent temporal encoding\n(vector passed to TFT\nas additional feature)" as ENC #DFF0D8

WIN --> LSTM
LSTM --> ENC

note bottom of LSTM
  Learns generic temporal
  response patterns:
   • diurnal cycles and ramps
   • lagged relationships PV ↔ weather
end note

note bottom of ENC
  Used alongside PVLib and covariates
  as input features to the TFT in
  both training and inference.
end note

@enduml
